  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Symposium - 2023 U.S.-India Aviation Summit, through American Association of Airport Executives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 2023 U.S.-India Aviation Summit will bring together senior representatives from the public and private sectors of India and the United States to bolster long-term strategic and commercial aviation cooperation. The Summit will consist of a one or two-day symposium, one day of site visits and off-site meetings, and a meeting of the U.S.-India Aviation Cooperation Program (ACP). The Summit will serve as a commercial, technical, and policy forum to assist civil aviation authorities and aviation industry representatives from India in identifying and specifying advanced U.S. technologies and practices best suited for their expansion and modernization needs. The Summit will address key issues related to aviation safety and security, air traffic management and control, airport and airline operations, sustainable aviation fuels and environmental best practices, procurement and financing options, and other aviation topics.</narrative>
  </description>
